   "from": "EX-CH07-S02",
   "about": "EX-CH07-S02..S08 (doc 24 §2.7, §2.9; STORY_FULL; doc 09 LOC-04): the Safe Room equipped for the storm with the M3-7A props. West: the shelter diagram by the hatch with its five role-colour seat markers (parked in S02, on the five seats from S03: the S02 -> S03 join) and the hatch's two indications (both agree from S06: S05 -> S06). North: the roll-call board now names five, April's four-name first-night card pinned beside it (S02); the valve diagram on the water wall from S04 with the return after the step-6 sample (S03 -> S04); the founder case on the seed latch from S04, latched 15 + 15 from S05 (S04 -> S05); the response board as the life-support board. South: the storm forecast table under the local telemetry, where the role plans meet (S03), the archive player plays the last log in the lull (S07, clue 21) and Mei lays it beside the packet, the signed page and the founder ledger; 'four steps left' on the telemetry (S07 -> S08). Storm steps S06-S08 run on reduced practicals with low amber guide strips (doc 09). Installed equipment: it stays after the chapter.",
